@startuml
' bt-view-kind: sequence
' bt-view-id: administration-tool:governed-mutation
title Administration Tool — Governed Mutation

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: operator
' bt-element-id: admin
' bt-element-id: manage
' bt-element-id: security
' bt-element-id: proxy
' bt-element-id: policy
' bt-element-id: backend

actor "Operator\nResponsibility: Inspect health and request governed changes\nContract: Authenticated browser session with explicit confirmation\n[[../../../../docs/architecture/components/administration-tool/architecture.md source]]" as operator
participant "Administration Tool\nResponsibility: Render operator workbenches and translate intent into backend requests\nContract: Flask routes; no direct domain persistence\n[[../../../../administration-tool/app.py source]]\n[[../components/c4-component.puml drill-down]]" as admin
participant "Manage Route Catalog\nResponsibility: Expose named operator workbench surfaces\nContract: Stable /manage route vocabulary\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_manage_sections.py source]]" as manage
participant "Security Routes\nResponsibility: Apply session and operator security checks\nContract: Authenticated, CSRF-aware browser mutation boundary\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_security.py source]]" as security
participant "Backend Proxy\nResponsibility: Forward allow-listed reads and mutations to backend\nContract: Method, path, timeout and response policy\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_proxy.py source]]" as proxy
participant "Proxy Policy\nResponsibility: Classify mutation endpoints and confirmation requirements\nContract: Default-deny unsafe or undeclared proxy operations\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_proxy_policy.py source]]" as policy
participant "Backend Admin API\nResponsibility: Authorize and execute governed mutations\nContract: HTTP /api/v1/admin and operator endpoints\n[[../../../../backend/app/api/v1/security_governance_routes.py source]]" as backend

manage -> proxy : "submits requested operation\ncontract: normalized proxy request\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_proxy.py source]]"
manage -> security : "requires operator session\ncontract: authorization before rendering or mutation\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_security.py source]]"
policy -> backend : "forwards approved operation\ncontract: service key and operator evidence\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_proxy.py source]]"
proxy -> policy : "classifies request\ncontract: default-deny mutation policy\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_proxy_policy.py source]]"
operator -> admin : "opens workbench\ncontract: authenticated browser navigation\n[[../../../../administration-tool/route_registration_manage_sections.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: sequence
Concern: End-to-end authorization and delegation of an operator mutation
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
